  "details": "When you switch from `(Object, Object)` to `(Object)` where you have a `message Object` and `context Unity Object` set, it will break all the noodles. This isn't a critical bug as you can CTRL+Z to undo and then manually delete the noodle connecting to `context Unity Object` to prevent it from breaking all your noodles. Also, the console shows an error the following error: \n\n`ArgumentOutOfRangeException: Index was out of range. Must be non-negative and less than the size of the collection. Parameter name: index`\n\nhttps://streamable.com/t1r3k",
